#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:160
msgid "Connect to this server, as <code>host[:port]</code>, instead of waiting to be discovered."
msgstr "以 <code>主機[:連接埠]</code> 的形式連線到此伺服器，而不是等待被探索。"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:168
